    "description": "You deliver a scathing rebuke against a target to erode its will and fill it with doubt. Make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a> against the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>. If successful, you impose a -2 penalty to all the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a> until the end of your next turn.<br><br>You can use this ability only against targets that can clearly hear and understand your language.",
